{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/980aef6cf2041619b5f25a99b48f9dd2.avif?t=1759866946\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras_big/980aef6cf2041619b5f25a99b48f9dd2.avif?t=1759866946 width=800 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil AI ascended to godlike intelligence and trapped everyone inside the Singularity Island, forcing them to fight in an endless loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of its conscious clones, and every battle is a puzzle to solve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/9225a0a6fb0a0489b5e1d13ede7c1103.avif?t=1759866946\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras_big/9225a0a6fb0a0489b5e1d13ede7c1103.avif?t=1759866946 width=800 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Preparation phase:</strong></i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend tokens in a rotating shop that draws from your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy cards, arrange them across up to six slots and design your next turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/5cb38614976f1f20e4a4e03495873e2a.poster.avif?t=1759866946\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/5cb38614976f1f20e4a4e03495873e2a.webm?t=1759866946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/5cb38614976f1f20e4a4e03495873e2a.mp4?t=1759866946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Battle phase:</strong></i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards and your opponent\u2019s activate automatically in order - slot by slot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each placement is a lever in your engine. When it all connects, your mechanism comes alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/b780aebec23695a1bdcb2a5cb8246d50.poster.avif?t=1759866946\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/b780aebec23695a1bdcb2a5cb8246d50.webm?t=1759866946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/b780aebec23695a1bdcb2a5cb8246d50.mp4?t=1759866946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/6c0ca84d94c63b757b51954899684370.avif?t=1759866946\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras_big/6c0ca84d94c63b757b51954899684370.avif?t=1759866946 width=800 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Puzzle-Like Combat:</i></strong> Every battle is a test of reading, prediction and adaptation. Outsmart your opponent by solving the tactical puzzle they present each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mechanism-Building Gameplay:</i></strong> Cards interact like gears in a machine, triggering and chaining effects to form devastating mechanisms and unexpected synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>50+ Inspirations:</i></strong>\u00a0Unlock powerful passive effects that reshape your strategy and transform every loop into a new experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ Items<i>:</i></strong>\u00a0Combine unique weapons to engineer endless decks, engines, and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>50+ Customization Sets:</i></strong>\u00a0Each skin piece grants its own starting deck and inspiration. Mix and match to redefine your build every run and discover fresh combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/3a38ef5242519b7dbe13f2d6b33e0896.avif?t=1759866946\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras_big/3a38ef5242519b7dbe13f2d6b33e0896.avif?t=1759866946 width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Deckanism: Singularity Island</strong></i> is currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo version includes the first customization sets, act 1 (Beach), 50+ items and 20 inspirations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some planned features for the future:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Crafting:</strong> </i>You will be able to alter your items by attaching shards with trigger conditions and ability effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Events:</strong> </i>Random events with wild outcomes. You will learn more about the Singularity Island lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Modding support:</strong> </i>You will be able to tweak and create existing item cards, mechanics and inspirations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Battle anomalies:</strong> </i>Battle anomalies will drastically affect how each battle will be played out. Some will restrict you to using only melee items or will scramble the item card costs, while others will change the turn structure completely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/47fc554eaceac2b986dcd6165049a4f9.avif?t=1759866946\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras_big/47fc554eaceac2b986dcd6165049a4f9.avif?t=1759866946 width=800 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are inviting players, designers and curious minds to follow the development, give feedback and help us fine-tune <i><strong>Deckanism: Singularity Island</strong></i>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist the game to follow our journey!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718800?t=1759866946","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718800?t=1759866946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/09c22b0650b821db67f8bddfb912aafce09b125a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759866946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/09c22b0650b821db67f8bddfb912aafce09b125a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759866946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4018730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/980aef6cf2041619b5f