thers will change the turn structure completely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras/47fc554eaceac2b986dcd6165049a4f9.avif?t=1759866946\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/extras_big/47fc554eaceac2b986dcd6165049a4f9.avif?t=1759866946 width=800 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are inviting players, designers and curious minds to follow the development, give feedback and help us fine-tune <i><strong>Deckanism: Singularity Island</strong></i>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist the game to follow our journey!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Arvis Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718800/a4a5f1df86a93d605ae6fc8e64794981443ad719/header.jpg?t=1759866946","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Silicon or Intel.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Silicon or Intel.</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3718800/449181491/c6a4fbefb315c98e81f55a87ae7a15e5cadbb9f3/1759334395/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759762225","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3718800/449181491/c6a4fbefb315c98e81f55a87ae7a15e5cadbb9f3/1759334395/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759762225","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/371880